  "title": "2026-11 绘画日志：Drawpile 远景娘绘画活动！",
  "summary": "Drawpile 远景娘绘画活动 远景娘近日入驻了Fox的Drawpile茶绘服务器，非常感谢 @时雨 @石英 … 继续阅读 2026-11 绘画日志：Drawpile 远景娘绘画活动！ →",
  "content": "<div>\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"640\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><strong>Drawpile 远景娘绘画活动</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>远景娘近日入驻了Fox的Drawpile茶绘服务器，<br>非常感谢 @时雨 @石英 参与的同人创作重绘！</p>\n\n\n\n<p>已经过去了五天，抽时间将之前的截图整理了一下。<br>以下是一些草稿的分享：当然也包括之前发布的Q娃neta的立绘，希望读者们喜欢！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"740\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"550\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"720\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"818\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard4-1024x818.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"736\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard5-1024x736.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"650\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"806\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard7-1024x806.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"752\" height=\"700\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Artboard8.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/58倒数2.3-1102-3_-_58倒数（2.3）_-_Drawpile_drawpile_TrhJ8gOd05.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"656\" height=\"458\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/58倒数2.3-1102-3_-_58倒数（2.3）_-_Drawpile_drawpile_TrhJ8gOd05.png\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/58倒数2.3-1102-3_-_58倒数（2.3）_-_Drawpile_drawpile_XNScoO6gJR.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img width=\"596\" height=\"292\" src=\"https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/58倒数2.3-1102-3_-_58倒数（2.3）_-_Drawpile_drawpile_XNScoO6gJR.png\" alt=\"\"></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://v1sta.xyz/artworks/2026-11-%e7%bb%98%e7%94%bb%e6%97%a5%e5%bf%97%ef%bc%9adrawpile-%e8%bf%9c%e6%99%af%e5%a8%98%e7%bb%98%e7%94%bb%e6%b4%bb%e5%8a%a8%ef%bc%81/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">来源</a></p>",
